#Conditional Statements
1.if
Syntax:
if condition:
    statement1
    statement2
    *if condition is true it will goes in statement1 and 2
statement M (to end/condition is false)

2.if-else statement
syntax:
if condition:
    statements(if true)
else:
    statement(if not true)

3.if,elif,else statement
-Here we use multiple elif condition between them
Syntax:
if condition:
   statement
elif condition:
    statement
else:
    statement

4.Nested  Statement
syntax:
if condition:
  statement
  if condition:
  elif condition:
  else:
else:

5.Ternary Operator /one line if else
syntax-
#ture-expression if condition else false-expression
